# Wingman net: rookie (young, eager, nervous, grows braver)

@wing.copy status
[rookie] Copy! Wilco, <lead>!
[rookie] Roger, I am on it!
[rookie] Copy that. Okay. Going now.
[rookie] Wilco! Uh, understood, I mean.
[rookie] Copy, <lead>. I will not mess it up.
[rookie rain] Copy. Rain is loud up here, but copy.

